  "consentTitle": "Help us improve Study Cafe",
  "consentBody": "With your permission, Study Cafe collects anonymous usage statistics and crash reports (Google Firebase Analytics and Crashlytics). They include things like which screens are used, your device model and Android version, and an app instance ID. They never include your name, email or study content. This data is processed on Google servers outside Türkiye. Nothing is collected until you choose.",
